        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1664768297497-e60629c80ef4?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NDg1OTAxMDZ8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post core" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;vuejscore&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/vuejs/core&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;vuejs/core&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;vuejscore-npm-build-status-download&#34;&gt;vuejs/core &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/package/vue&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/npm/v/vue.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;npm&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/vuejs/core/actions/workflows/ci.yml&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/vuejs/core/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg?branch=main&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;build status&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/package/vue&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/vue&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Download&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting Started
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please follow the documentation at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://vuejs.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;vuejs.org&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;sponsors&#34;&gt;Sponsors
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vue.js is an MIT-licensed open source project with its ongoing development made possible entirely by the support of these awesome &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/BACKERS.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;backers&lt;/a&gt;. If you&amp;rsquo;d like to join them, please consider &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://vuejs.org/sponsor/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt; sponsoring Vue&amp;rsquo;s development&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;h3 align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;Special Sponsor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a target=&#34;_blank&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/appwrite/appwrite&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&#34;special sponsor appwrite&#34; src=&#34;https://sponsors.vuejs.org/images/appwrite.svg&#34; width=&#34;300&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a target=&#34;_blank&#34; href=&#34;https://vuejs.org/sponsor/#current-sponsors&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img alt=&#34;sponsors&#34; src=&#34;https://sponsors.vuejs.org/sponsors.svg?v3&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;questions&#34;&gt;Questions
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For questions and support please use &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://forum.vuejs.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the official forum&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://chat.vuejs.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;community chat&lt;/a&gt;. The issue list of this repo is &lt;strong&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; for bug reports and feature requests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;issues&#34;&gt;Issues
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please make sure to respect issue requirements and use &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://new-issue.vuejs.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the new issue helper&lt;/a&gt; when opening an issue. Issues not conforming to the guidelines may be closed immediately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;stay-in-touch&#34;&gt;Stay In Touch
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://x.com/vuejs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://x.com/vuejs&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/vuejs.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Bluesky&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.vuejs.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://vuejobs.com/?ref=vuejs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Job Board&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contribution&#34;&gt;Contribution
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please make sure to read the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/.github/contributing.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contributing Guide&lt;/a&gt; before making a pull request. If you have a Vue-related project/component/tool, add it with a pull request to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/vuejs/awesome-vue&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;this curated list&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you to all the people who already contributed to Vue!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/vuejs/core/graphs/contributors&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://opencollective.com/vuejs/contributors.svg?width=890&amp;limit=500&#34; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Showing the first 500 contributors only due to GitHub image size limitations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;license&#34;&gt;License
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;MIT&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
